WEBVTT

00:00:12.472 --> 00:00:13.472
(IN SPANISH)

00:00:23.392 --> 00:00:24.432
Woody!

00:00:26.672 --> 00:00:28.272
Come on. We're almost there.

00:00:28.392 --> 00:00:29.432
(IN SPANISH)

00:00:33.752 --> 00:00:34.832
(GRUNTING)

00:00:37.232 --> 00:00:39.552
Buzz, come here. Give me a lift.

00:00:41.912 --> 00:00:42.952
(VOICE BOX SPEAKING SPANISH)

00:00:49.912 --> 00:00:51.032
It is open.

00:00:51.352 --> 00:00:53.272
Oh, way to go, Buzz. Come on.

00:00:57.632 --> 00:01:00.752
-Is it safe?
-I guess I'll find out.

00:01:05.232 --> 00:01:06.632
(PANTING)

00:01:07.112 --> 00:01:09.072
JESSIE: Woody? You okay?
WOODY: Yeah.

00:01:09.632 --> 00:01:11.792
Come on down. But not all at once.

00:01:11.912 --> 00:01:12.952
MR. POTATO HEAD: What did he say?

00:01:13.112 --> 00:01:14.152
HAMM: I think he said, "All at once."

00:01:14.272 --> 00:01:15.472
No. No. No, no, no, no, no!

00:01:15.552 --> 00:01:16.912
REX: Geronimo!
HAMM: Look out!

00:01:20.592 --> 00:01:21.632
Thanks, Jess.

00:01:21.752 --> 00:01:22.792
(IN SPANISH)

00:01:23.992 --> 00:01:25.072
Almost there, guys.

00:01:25.272 --> 00:01:27.232
Slink, you think you can make it?

00:01:27.312 --> 00:01:30.552
Well, I might be old,
but I still got a spring in my step.

00:01:32.952 --> 00:01:34.832
JESSIE: He did it!
HAMM: All right, Slinkykins.

00:01:34.952 --> 00:01:36.632
Okay, climb across.

00:01:39.672 --> 00:01:40.672
You lost, little doggie?

00:01:40.752 --> 00:01:41.752
(GASPS)

00:01:44.992 --> 00:01:47.432
Well, well. Look who's back.

00:01:55.592 --> 00:01:57.112
CHATTER TELEPHONE:
I'm sorry, cowboy.

00:01:57.192 --> 00:01:58.272
(GASPS)

00:01:58.672 --> 00:01:59.992
They broke me.

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:02.832
What are y'all doing?
Running back to your kid?

00:02:03.512 --> 00:02:05.592
He don't want you no more.

00:02:05.672 --> 00:02:06.872
-That's a lie.
-LOTSO: Is it?

00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:09.112
Tell me this, Sheriff.

00:02:09.192 --> 00:02:12.272
If your kid loves you so much,
why is he leaving?

00:02:12.792 --> 00:02:14.632
You think you're special, cowboy?

00:02:14.992 --> 00:02:19.272
You're a piece of plastic.
You were made to be thrown away.

00:02:19.352 --> 00:02:20.712
(GARBAGE TRUCK BEEPING)

00:02:20.792 --> 00:02:22.472
Speak of the devil.

00:02:27.192 --> 00:02:28.312
(JESSIE GASPS)

00:02:28.392 --> 00:02:31.552
Now, we need toys
in our Caterpillar Room

00:02:31.672 --> 00:02:34.312
and you need to avoid that truck.

00:02:34.392 --> 00:02:38.312
Why don't you come on back,
join our family again?

00:02:38.392 --> 00:02:41.832
This isn't a family! It's a prison!
You're a liar and a bully!

00:02:42.312 --> 00:02:46.312
And I'd rather rot in this dumpster
than join any family of yours!

00:02:46.392 --> 00:02:50.072
Jessie's right! Authority should derive
from the consent of the governed,

00:02:50.192 --> 00:02:51.472
not from the threat of force.

00:02:52.832 --> 00:02:54.752
If that's what you want.

00:02:56.632 --> 00:02:59.752
Barbie! Wait! Don't do this, Lotso.

00:02:59.832 --> 00:03:03.992
She's a Barbie doll, Ken.
There's a hundred million just like her.

00:03:04.872 --> 00:03:06.152
Not to me, there's not.

00:03:06.672 --> 00:03:07.672
Oh!

00:03:07.752 --> 00:03:10.392
Fine. Then why don't you join her!

00:03:12.912 --> 00:03:14.672
Oh, Ken!

00:03:14.752 --> 00:03:15.992
Everyone, listen!

00:03:16.072 --> 00:03:19.432
Sunnyside could be cool and groovy
if we treated each other fair.

00:03:19.912 --> 00:03:22.672
It's Lotso.
He's made us into a pyramid,

00:03:22.752 --> 00:03:24.432
and he put himself on top!

00:03:24.552 --> 00:03:26.512
Anyone concur with Ken?

00:03:29.672 --> 00:03:32.352
I didn't throw you away. Your kid did.

00:03:32.432 --> 00:03:37.112
Ain't one kid ever loved a toy, really.
Chew on that when you're at the dump.

00:03:37.192 --> 00:03:39.112
Wait! What about Daisy?

00:03:41.392 --> 00:03:43.112
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:03:43.232 --> 00:03:45.872
Daisy? You used to do
everything with her?

00:03:45.952 --> 00:03:47.912
-Yeah? Then she threw us out.
-WOODY: No.

00:03:48.392 --> 00:03:50.792
-She lost you.
-She replaced us!

00:03:50.872 --> 00:03:52.712
She replaced you.

00:03:52.792 --> 00:03:54.592
And if you couldn't have her
then no one could.

00:03:54.832 --> 00:03:57.192
You lied to Big Baby
and you've been lying ever since.

00:03:57.592 --> 00:03:58.632
(WHIMPERS)

00:03:58.712 --> 00:04:01.032
-Where'd you get that?
-She loved you, Lotso.

00:04:01.112 --> 00:04:02.312
She never loved me.

00:04:02.432 --> 00:04:04.312
As much as any kid ever loved a toy.

00:04:08.592 --> 00:04:09.752
Mama.

00:04:09.992 --> 00:04:12.472
What? You want your mommy back?

00:04:12.592 --> 00:04:15.392
She never loved you.
Don't be such a baby!

00:04:17.672 --> 00:04:18.752
(CRYING)

00:04:18.832 --> 00:04:20.112
Push 'em in. All of 'em!

00:04:21.152 --> 00:04:24.232
This is what happens
when you dummies try to think.

00:04:24.312 --> 00:04:28.912
We're all just trash, waiting to be
thrown away! That's all a toy is!

00:04:30.672 --> 00:04:33.592
Hey, stop it! Put me down, you idiot!

00:04:34.312 --> 00:04:35.512
(YELLING)

00:04:35.672 --> 00:04:38.152
No! No! Wait a minute! Big Baby, wait!

00:04:41.272 --> 00:04:43.512
-REX: He's gone!
-Holy cow.

00:04:44.432 --> 00:04:45.992
(BLOWING RASPBERRY)

00:04:48.592 --> 00:04:49.832
WOODY: Come on. Hurry!

00:04:53.992 --> 00:04:55.112
(ALIENS SQUEAKING)

00:04:56.792 --> 00:04:57.752
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:04:57.872 --> 00:04:58.872
(IN SPANISH)

00:05:02.032 --> 00:05:03.152
-(EXCLAIMS)
-Woody!

00:05:05.992 --> 00:05:07.032
(GASPS)

00:05:07.952 --> 00:05:09.712
HAMM: Oh, boy. Incoming!

00:05:12.112 --> 00:05:13.152
Come on!

00:05:14.632 --> 00:05:15.672
Barbie, no!

00:05:20.312 --> 00:05:21.392
Woody!

00:05:22.552 --> 00:05:23.712
(ALL EXCLAIMING)

00:05:25.312 --> 00:05:26.472
No!

00:05:29.552 --> 00:05:30.792
(TOYS COUGHING)

00:05:30.872 --> 00:05:32.992
WOODY: Can you hear me?
Is everyone okay?

00:05:33.072 --> 00:05:35.912
MR. POTATO HEAD: Of course not,
you imbecile. We're doomed!

00:05:37.912 --> 00:05:39.392
Everyone, go to Buzz. Come on.

00:05:41.912 --> 00:05:43.912
We all here? Slinky? Rex?

00:05:43.992 --> 00:05:45.232
(THUD)

00:05:48.192 --> 00:05:50.112
WOODY: Against the wall, everybody.
Quick!

00:05:50.192 --> 00:05:51.232
(IN SPANISH)

00:05:52.392 --> 00:05:53.432
JESSIE: Buzz!

00:05:54.712 --> 00:05:55.832
(CALLS IN SPANISH)

00:05:56.672 --> 00:05:57.992
(GRUNTING)

00:06:03.912 --> 00:06:04.992
They'll never make it!

00:06:14.872 --> 00:06:15.912
Look out!

00:06:17.832 --> 00:06:18.952
(GASPING)

00:06:20.712 --> 00:06:21.792
Buzz!

00:06:28.752 --> 00:06:31.552
-Anyone see him?
-Over here, y'all. I found him.

00:06:35.192 --> 00:06:36.792
Buzz, you okay?

00:06:37.472 --> 00:06:39.952
Buzz! Buzz!

00:06:46.312 --> 00:06:47.872
(SNIFFING)

00:06:50.432 --> 00:06:51.552
That wasn't me, was it?

00:06:51.632 --> 00:06:55.632
Oh, Buzz, you're back! You're back,
you're back, you're back, you're back!

00:06:55.712 --> 00:06:58.272
Yes, I'm back. Where have I been?

00:06:58.632 --> 00:07:00.592
Beyond infinity, Space Ranger.

00:07:00.792 --> 00:07:03.832
Woody! So where are we now?

00:07:04.112 --> 00:07:06.392
In a garbage truck
on the way to the dump!

00:07:14.672 --> 00:07:15.792
(RUMBLING)

00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:21.672
WOODY: Hold on, we're going in!

